  "body": "Perched high above Waiake with sweeping views over Rangitoto Island and the Hauraki Gulf, Waiake Rise presents eight brand-new, architecturally designed homes, including a rare two level residence.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n4 Bedrooms, 3 Bathrooms, 2 Lounges (including a master suite)\r\n\r\nFloor Area: approx. 137m² excel incl Garage/Carport covered parking\r\n\r\nAppliances: Premium Bosch package\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern family living, this light-filled home combines elegant open-plan spaces, premium finishes, and warm contemporary tones. Built by a reputable construction company in collaboration with two acclaimed architectural firms, ensuring outstanding quality and craftsmanship throughout.\r\n\r\nEach residence has been thoughtfully positioned to capture natural light and enjoy beautiful elevated outlooks. Generous floor-to-ceiling windows, north-facing orientation, and private courtyards create a perfect blend of comfort and style.\r\n\r\nSchool Zones:\r\n\r\nLong Bay College - 5 mins drive\r\n\r\nNorthcross Intermediate - 5 mins drive\r\n\r\nTorbay School - 2 mins drive",
